  _terminalFeed: "Hey there, newbie. Sadly, I won\u2019t be there to show you the
    ropes.\r\nBut the job is simple, really! You will get crypted messages from our
    astronauts to your Terminal. Don\u2019t be intimidated, I left you a reference
    sheet to decrypt them :P\r\nUse Decryptor to send decrypted messages to our database.
    You will be rewarded for each decrypted message. Piece of cake!\r\nDon\u2019t
    be shy to make notes if messages turn out to be long and tricky.\r\nIf you feel
    bored, well\u2026 It\u2019s not a lot but there is a minesweeper I downloaded!\r\nHave
    fun and have a good night.\r\nYour mentor Susan xoxo\n\n\n9(20)_1_20(5)19(20)"
